</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">2.0.0 draft 1</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">10 December 2025</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">SJC</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_430d84f3-f9d3-a9ad-f6fc-a7e86853d840" id="_430d84f3-f9d3-a9ad-f6fc-a7e86853d840"></a>Update figures and contents to align with renamed items accepted in GI Registry; Correct typo in 10.2.6.3 PT_Locale.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">2.0.0 draft 2</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">11 December 2025</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">SJC</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_88cbe95a-718c-aae7-58b6-2c88095b34a7" id="_88cbe95a-718c-aae7-58b6-2c88095b34a7"></a>Change one of the theComponent roles to theFuzzyComponent</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">2.0.0 draft 3</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">19 January 2026</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">SJC</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a956f11b-e13f-c828-1bc5-b934cec09cd9" id="_a956f11b-e13f-c828-1bc5-b934cec09cd9"></a>Refine the document and relax some multiplicity restrictions on discovery metadata.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">2.0.0 draft 4</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">23 March 2026</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">SJC</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e7557107-ed38-8d35-db95-0e1cb92fe237" id="_e7557107-ed38-8d35-db95-0e1cb92fe237"></a>Apply revisions from NIPWG review</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p class="MsoNormal">&#xA0;</p></div>
