      <div><a name="sec_10.2.5" id="sec_10.2.5"></a><h3>10.2.5<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>S100_CatalogueDiscoveryMetadata</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_bbd0f60f-8ad3-4e59-89b0-a2f278d94ad0" id="_bbd0f60f-8ad3-4e59-89b0-a2f278d94ad0"></a>This is an optional element that allows for the delivery of S-123 Feature and Portrayal Catalogues within the Exchange Set.</p>

